<attribute name="mainDescription" nodeId="6aac70f1">The records, documents, explanations, and other information, including significant judgments, provided as outlined in the
information request or as part of information gathering activities. These may include, but are not limited to processes,
procedures, policies, financial data, legal and regulatory filings and other documents or tangible records, whether in
physical or electronic format.</attribute>
<attribute name="externalId" nodeId="7133962b"></attribute>
<attribute name="keyConsiderations" nodeId="5f932fb7">&lt;p&gt;
    The information gathered should be a collection of current, relevant information and data that is key to understanding
    the client&apos;s current situation. This information should be relative to the scope of the engagement.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    This information may be collected from existing materials or gathered directly from the client via submitting
    information requests, through interviews, discussions, or workshops, or by other means as appropriate.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
<attribute name="longPresentationName" nodeId="dcb0228a"></attribute>
<attribute name="purpose" nodeId="1c75420a">&lt;p&gt;
